Magnifier: Qt Quick 2 ShaderEffect

ShaderEffectItem (Qt 4 labs) is ShaderEffect in Qt 5, with qt_Matrix and top-down texture
coordinates. The frame is a plain Image under the glass: as a third texture of the effect it
came out empty on the SGX. declarativeView (Qt 4 MDeclarativeView) is gone.

diff --git a/src/meego/Magnifier.qml b/src/meego/Magnifier.qml
